Original commit body from 8ea5922:

The run command should capture the full behavior map for maximum
flexibility. Test filtering is better done at query time:

- `sketch -x` for ephemeral analysis (speed matters)
- `symbols -x`, `explain -x`, `slice -x` for filtered views

Having -x on run causes permanent data loss in the results file,
breaks test-coverage command, and is redundant with downstream
filtering options.
